src/special/erfc.rs is ported from the Rust crate libm 0.2.16 (src/math/erf.rs,
https://github.com/rust-lang/libm), a port of musl libc (https://www.musl-libc.org/), whose
erf is FreeBSD msun's s_erf.c from Sun Microsystems' fdlibm.

